This project plans a Bangla-focused adaptation of Laya by Convai Innovations.

Upstream source: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Upstream model family: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
Planned base checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual

The upstream source and model cards declare the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This repository currently contains project documentation and configuration;
upstream model weights are not bundled with it.

laya-bangla is an independent project. References to upstream names identify
the origin of the work and do not imply endorsement.
